<test1>
<ptxt>Disconnect connector A of the air conditioner amplifier assembly.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Using SST (Toyota electrical tester), measure the resistance between the connector terminals of the vehicle wire harness and between the terminals and body ground. (see <xref label="Seep02" href="RM0000005KW01EX"/> for Terminals of ECU)</ptxt>
